{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy farming atmosphere without time pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A touch of survival and challenging boss mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A story that stretches from classic levels across the open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lots of craftable items at various crafting tables and furnaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The character creator offers you a variety of folks, hairstyles, beards and many colors to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Be creative! Freely build and modify a random generated sandbox world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A modernized 16-bit SNES art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/game-as-gif-2024-06-28.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You visit the fair and come across a wonderful snow globe. But when you touch it, you find yourself in a peculiar environment. Before you lies a path to explore that raises puzzles but also leads you into a new world. Upon arrival, you discover resources, animals, and plants, and you can build a cozy life. Interlaced with ancient ruins, this world also holds clues about an ancient civilization, and some encounters in your new home require your combat skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover ancient paths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-rift.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the magic bridges through the Rift and find your snow globe world. However, something is not right here. This odd place is riddled with strange scars and lost souls of a long forgotten time. What happened here in the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use helpful tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-digging.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig up the ground and irrigate fields to make your plants thrive. Cut down trees, pound stone and mine ores in the procedurally generated world to unlock new recipes. In large and small ruins you can find more useful items for your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow your crops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-farming.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your adventures you will find different plants, which you can cultivate on your fields. Bake bread and apple pie or cook honey carrots. A welcome refreshment for new construction projects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft items </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-crafting.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From stoves to crafting tables, you can process the world's resources into countless items. Craft sturdier picks to crack harder rocks, new equipment to roam the world more safely, and many decorations for your new home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be Fearless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-blargh.gif?t=1730715602\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some dangers in the world are greater than expected. Prepare well and cleanse corrupted places from the Rift Guardians, for they may one day be the key to returning home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/wishlist-follow.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share your Ideas </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm a Solo-Dev developing A World of Little Legends entirely live on Twitch. Be part of the community and share your feedback and ideas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/discord-twitch.png?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We speak English! Mostly German though, hence just drop in and we\u2019ll switch. &lt;3 </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1476680/42acc5b09676436c721426bb86506adb38678886.jpg"},{"name":"Catboy Viking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1476680/1fe6324c47bf29fefa15f969232e135dfecb749a.jpg"},{"name":"Heart of the Developer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1476680/1098533317f08ff9d3d0ddc3507a8817652897be.jpg"},{"name":"Copper Age","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1476680/2b43173cbb9ab2a523043a98dc05a2a377e38106.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Member","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1476680/205c3f3d62dd74a50e936facd766b12c26d1914b.jpg"},{"name":"Praise the Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1476680/48c35f32aff317cb1ac2ecdce86c2fd0953a6e00.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a Pun King","path":"ht