d world to unlock new recipes. In large and small ruins you can find more useful items for your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow your crops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-farming.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your adventures you will find different plants, which you can cultivate on your fields. Bake bread and apple pie or cook honey carrots. A welcome refreshment for new construction projects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft items </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-crafting.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From stoves to crafting tables, you can process the world's resources into countless items. Craft sturdier picks to crack harder rocks, new equipment to roam the world more safely, and many decorations for your new home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be Fearless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/steam-blargh.gif?t=1730715602\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some dangers in the world are greater than expected. Prepare well and cleanse corrupted places from the Rift Guardians, for they may one day be the key to returning home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/wishlist-follow.gif?t=1730715602\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share your Ideas </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm a Solo-Dev developing A World of Little Legends 